<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Goodyear cut by J.P. Morgan.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goodyear cut by J.P. Morgan.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan Securities said it downgraded Goodyear Tire &amp; Rubber Co to market performer from buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Our bullish sentiment on Goodyear has waned over the last few months as we have observed the impact of the continuing tire price wars in the U.S. market,&quot; the brokerage said in a report.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 20 percent since early October through Tuesday, J.P. Morgan said.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 3/8 at 53-1/8.</p>
</text>
